WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Every event starts with a plan.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.900
And then the event changes.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.800
More guests. Another bartender. A different time.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.900
QuotePilot shows you what that change means before it becomes the new plan.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.900
Pricing. Margin. Staffing. Production.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The event changed. QuotePilot knows what that means.
